{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesfNGTmwwRmvWHci9GtH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. **Command:** `./mvnw test` from the sample-service directory\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 21\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n\n**Verification of requirements:**\n1. ✅ Existing build passes\n2. ✅ Existing tests pass (4 baseline order tests + 5 baseline shipment tests)\n3. ✅ POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels active orders, persists, and cancels CREATED shipments\n4. ✅ Error responses consistent with error envelope (status + error code + message)\n5. ✅ All error cases tested:\n   - Repeated cancel succeeds (idempotent) ✓\n   - Cancel blocked by CONFIRMED shipment changes nothing ✓\n   - Unknown order returns 404 ✓\n   - Shipment for cancelled order returns 409 ✓\n6. ✅ No new Maven dependencies\n7. ✅ Only modified order and shipment features plus api package\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. **Existing build passes** — Build succeeded with all 21 tests passing\n2. **Existing tests pass** — 4 baseline order + 5 baseline shipment + 1 smoke + 3 customer = 13 existing tests all passing\n3. **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels CREATED shipments** — Test `cancel cancels created shipments for the order` covers this\n4. **Error responses consistent** — All errors follow the ApiError envelope pattern; new error code ORDER_CANCELLED_ERROR added to ErrorCode enum\n5. **Repeated cancel succeeds; cancel blocked by CONFIRMED shipment changes nothing; unknown order 404; shipment for cancelled order 409** — Five new tests cover all these cases:\n   - `cancelling already cancelled order succeeds and changes nothing`\n   - `cancel with confirmed shipment returns 409 and changes nothing`\n   - `cancelling unknown order returns 404`\n   - `rejects creating shipment for cancelled order with 409`\n   - `